  "slug": "expense-reimbursement-evaluation-form",
  "title": "Expense Reimbursement Evaluation Form",
  "subtitle": "Use this evaluation to apply explicit criteria to traceable evidence, calibrate the conclusion, authorize action, and preserve limitations for a expense reimbursement workflow.",
  "description": "An original operational expense reimbursement evaluation form that controls a employee business-expense claim and substantiation record from identity and routing through evidence, qualified decision, exception management, implementation, handoff, and final verification.",
  "use_case": "Use when the employee claimant, manager, or expense processor needs a traceable evaluation so the authorized manager, finance, payroll, tax, or compliance reviewer can reimburse, partially reimburse, return, deny, recode, offset an advance, or escalate the claim under the current expense policy, approval limits, receipt and substantiation rules, project coding, and applicable tax requirements without relying on an informal email, spreadsheet, or unreviewed narrative.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
